@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #F7FAFC
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam ArrowColor #334E68
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.4
skinparam RectangleBorderColor #486581
skinparam RectangleFontColor #102A43
skinparam rectangle {
  RoundCorner 12
  Padding 12
}

title Molinex - DDD Context Map
caption Strategic relationships between Bounded Contexts inside one modular monolith. Lines describe model integration, not independent deployments.

top to bottom direction

rectangle "Commercial Engagement\nSupporting Subdomain" as commercial #F1F5F9
rectangle "Identity and Access Management\nGeneric Subdomain" as iam #F1F5F9
rectangle "Production Management\nCore Subdomain" as production #E6F4EA
rectangle "Quality and Yield Control\nCore Subdomain" as quality #E6F4EA
rectangle "Asset and Maintenance Management\nCore Subdomain" as maintenance #E6F4EA
rectangle "Operational Intelligence\nCore Subdomain" as intelligence #E6F4EA
rectangle "Reporting and Analytics\nSupporting Subdomain / Read Side" as reporting #F1F5F9
rectangle "Production-Quality Shared Kernel\nWeight, MeasurementUnit" as shared_kernel #FFE27A

commercial .. iam : Separate Ways\nNo confirmed onboarding contract

iam --> production : Open Host Service / Published Language\nAuthenticatedPrincipal and role claims
iam --> quality : Open Host Service / Published Language\nAuthenticatedPrincipal and role claims
iam --> maintenance : Open Host Service / Published Language\nAuthenticatedPrincipal and role claims
iam --> intelligence : Open Host Service / Published Language\nAuthenticatedPrincipal and role claims
iam --> reporting : Open Host Service / Published Language\nAuthenticatedPrincipal and role claims

production --> quality : Customer / Supplier + Published Language\nProductionInformationRecorded / Updated
quality --> intelligence : Customer / Supplier + Published Language\nQualityDeviationIdentified
maintenance <--> intelligence : Partnership + Published Language\nMachineRegistered, AnomalyDetected,\nCorrectiveMaintenanceRecorded

production --> reporting : Customer / Supplier + Published Language\nProduction events
quality --> reporting : Customer / Supplier + Published Language\nQuality and yield events
maintenance --> reporting : Customer / Supplier + Published Language\nMaintenance events
intelligence --> reporting : Customer / Supplier + Published Language\nAnomaly and alert events

production -- shared_kernel : shares
quality -- shared_kernel : shares

commercial -[hidden]right-> iam
iam -[hidden]right-> production
production -[hidden]right-> quality
quality -[hidden]down-> maintenance
maintenance -[hidden]right-> intelligence
intelligence -[hidden]down-> reporting

legend bottom
|= Notation |= Meaning |
| Solid directed line | Upstream provides a contract to a downstream consumer |
| Bidirectional line | Partnership with coordinated evolution |
| Dotted line | Separate Ways; no integration contract currently exists |
| Yellow box | Explicit and deliberately small Shared Kernel |
endlegend
@enduml
